              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la prensa — \"the press\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La prensa habló mucho del caso. The press talked a lot about the case."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La prensa is the newspapers and the journalists together. Una rueda de prensa is a press conference."
            }
          ]
        },
