              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "publicar — \"to publish\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "El periódico publicó la noticia el domingo. The newspaper published the news on Sunday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It takes qu before e: publiqué. Publicar en internet is to post online."
            }
          ]
        },
